# This git repository's root is the home directory, with the app in
# Bid-Consolidator/. Ignore EVERYTHING at the root except the app and CI, so a
# stray `git add -A` can never stage personal files (shell history, tokens in
# dotfiles, Documents, …). Recommended long-term: make Bid-Consolidator/ its own
# repository root.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/Bid-Consolidator/
